WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.920
<i>I... am being blackmailed by Komine Nozomi.</i>

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:07.930
Morning Kimio-kun ♪

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.940
<i>This is the compensation:
Exposing our body to each other.</i>

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.970
<i>The game of exhibitionism.</i>

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.200
Nozo x Kimi

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:32.000
The Clubroom Ghost

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.440
Thank you Kimio-kun.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.210
This is all of it right, Makino?

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:42.450
Yeah.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:45.160
Sorry... you saved me!

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.460
Makino-San, professor's calling you!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.400
I'm coming!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.220
Sorry, Kimio-kun.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.050
I'll thank you properly some other time.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.420
Don't worry about it, see you.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.130
<i>Good for you Makino, you've gotten better.</i>

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.580
Yes, understood.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.800
Alright! Practice is done for today!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.970
Thank you very much!

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.470
A blackout?

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.220
At that moment, the lights shut off...

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.570
...and in the window from the clubroom...

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.230
...there was a huge white shadow!!!

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.360
Well? Well? Did you get scared?

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.360
I almost pissed my pants!

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:19.980
As expected from the schools phantomaniac<b>
to tell such a believable story.</b>

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:21.640
Ghosts, huh?

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.350
What do you think, Kimio-kun?

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:30.090
N-nothing really... that stuff is all garbage.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:35.440
But Watanuki-San, you said you've
never seen that ghost before right?

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.440
Unfortunately that's true...

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:41.320
It's because I went home early yesterday.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.400
A failure I'll never regret.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.230
The most interested person
and you didn't get to see it.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.230
Ironic, isn't it?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.600
However! I am going to spread the word
about what I heard, around school...

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.080
You're gonna spread the word?!

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.850
You guys got a moment?

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:02.160
If that's all, then leave it to us!

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:04.900
KI-MI-O-KUN

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.970
W-what are you guys doing?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:11.410
We can't just stand still while the cute
swimming club girls as for our help!

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:14.230
We'll get rid of that ghost, ya hear?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.090
What?!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.740
Will you help us?

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:20.630
Everyone's all afraid so
they are not coming to the club.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.940
Teacher is saying we are just seeing things.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.730
And the boys from swimming club
aren't taking it seriously.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.610
Our last hope is asking for help
from the male classmates.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.080
Please? Can you help us too Suga-kun?

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:33.810
I... uh...

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:39.890
The reward would be to go on a date with them
to the festival, and they will wear yukatas!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.860
So that's what you're after...

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.710
Exactly!

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:50.010
Please, we'll even send Watanuki
to go find it with you guys.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.000
Me?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.340
...we'll leave it up to you, Kimio.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.980
Wait, guys!!!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.440
That story...

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:02.820
...sounds interesting.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.510
Suga-kun and I will take care of it.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:14.080
Basically, as much as you really want to
see a ghost, they aren't so easy to find.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:15.660
Isn't it exciting?

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.340
N-not really...

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.300
'course it is!

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:26.130
It's like something beautiful and unusual
happening in your life every day!

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.350
I feel you!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.820
Komine-San, I'm so happy.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:35.540
I just knew I would get along with you.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.820
No need for manners, just call me Nozomi.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.700
Yay! I'm so thrilled!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:44.620
There's only one person here who's face
says they really don't want to see ghosts.

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:45.930
Right?

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:48.070
What's with that weird bond?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.620
Once upon a time, in a certain place...

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:56.460
...there was a ghost that
would stare at a guy.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:56.920
Wh...

00:04:57.220 --> 00:05:00.340
This ghost would stare at the guy non-stop.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.340
So absurd, there's no such thing as ghosts!

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.410
Where are you going?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.110
Bathroom.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.730
Nozomi-Chan, how do you plan
to scare away the ghost?

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.120
Are you against scaring them away, Watanuki-San?

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:30.920
K-kinda.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.740
I'd like to leave them in
peace if it's possible.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.500
It's a ghost that just appeared.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.840
Y-yeah! We should just leave it alone.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.670
We can just ask the swimming club
to change somewhere else.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.650
If it were a real ghost...

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:54.070
...unfortunately, those are all stories
from people that just saw wrong

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.070
or are making it up.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:59.910
What I want to drive away, is all the fake tales.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:04.640
The only thing that should be able to
scare you, is a real ghost itself.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.340
Don't you think?

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:08.740
Yeah...

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.740
Why do we have to spy on the swimming club?

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.400
It's all a part of the plan.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.650
Check it out Kimio-kun!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.090
You like that don't you?

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.500
You know...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.250
Here!

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.650
You like apples more than
oranges right, Kimio-kun?

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.350
Oh, thank you.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.020
Did I ever even tell you that?

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.500
I can tell just by looking.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:49.430
As always.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.530
Oh, it's Watanuki-San!

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.190
I wonder if the ghost will appear again.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.430
He'll come, he'll come, I'm sure of it.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.130
You only say that because you haven't seen it.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.440
It was super scary!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.730
I bet it will come out today too.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.730
No way, don't say stuff like that.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.370
Watanuki looks pretty happy.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:13.460
It's because of her that ghost are
becoming the popular thing around school.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.250
I'm sure she's happy.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.370
Hey!

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:24.530
Watanuki made me remember
something very important.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:25.880
What?

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.400
Don't stop so suddenly!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:35.280
The reason you and I are involved in this.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.880
Just like how Watanuki-San is with ghosts.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:45.670
I want to feel that way, real
excitement, with you Kimio-kun.

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:50.650
Well, let's go back.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.100
It'll be time when night falls.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.170
Alright, it's about that time.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:01.660
Though I have no idea if the
ghost will come out or not.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:05.060
Is it just two of us?

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.430
Maybe we should call Watanuki?

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:09.570
Well then Kimio-kun, you gonna get her?

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.820
Hey, go open that door.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.820
N-no way in hell!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:18.380
We never told Watanuki-San that we
were going to investigate today.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.050
She'd get worried.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.860
Hey, where are you going?

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.690
There's something I want to check.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.710
You stay here and keep watch for the ghost.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.880
K-Ko-Komine!

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:32.890
Wow, Misaki's bathing suit is so sexy!

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.890
Take it off! Take it off!

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.480
Stop it!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.960
You're wearing something this erotic.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:53.990
I said stop!

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.730
Hey, did you all forget?

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.560
If you take too long changing,
the ghost will come out!

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.410
O-oh yeah.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.770
Gotta change, gotta change.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:03.320
Again?!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.660
I will not stand for this guy
getting in the way of the club.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.210
Get him girls!

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:14.780
Wait! You're not getting away!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.500
Okay!

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:18.570
There it is!

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.530
Su-Suga-kun...?

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.750
Oh um... the ghost just ran away...

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.040
Why are you here?

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.800
Wait... could it be that...

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.880
you were peeping on us changing?!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.250
I can't believe it, peeping tom!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:40.130
So then that ghost was all you, Suga Kimio?

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.410
Did you hear the rumors
about the ghost at the pool?

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:55.860
I know, I know. They say
it was Suga from Class B.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.760
He pretended to be a ghost to get a
peep at girls changing, he's the worst.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.060
I heard it all, Kimio.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:06.080
Good shit man. Because, you
didn't wanna be the ghost-buster.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.630
That's because you're still a little boy.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.970
Murakami, Tomita,

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:14.420
if you keep talking to that perv,
I'll treat you guys like pervs too

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:17.090
and cancel our date.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:20.850
No, we were just telling Kimio that we
weren't going to talk to him anymore.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.650
We're never talking again!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.370
That's fine then.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.950
Isn't it about time you speak up?
Tell them the truth.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.340
That you're not the culprit.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.340
Even if it's to me.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.210
I don't care.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.750
It's just as the swimming club says.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:40.700
You're lying,

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:43.700
you're not the type to be peeping.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:46.760
Why not? I am a boy after all.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:49.890
See?

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:52.170
Because that was out of nowhere!

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:55.240
Enough. Can't you just leave me alone?

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:59.380
Hiding is against the rules of our game.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.830
Quit saying stupid things.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.650
There are things I can't say.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.480
Stop!

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:07.320
Watanuki-San.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.360
Watanuki-San.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:11.570
You guys shouldn't be fighting.

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:13.570
That ghost...

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.570
...was me!

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.220
Just as I thought.

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:23.610
Komine... You...

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:30.360
Ever since you said you never
saw the ghost I got suspicious.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:36.960
You were happier to talk about the ghost, than
you were sad about not getting to see it.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:38.820
What's more,

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:43.100
is that there wasn't any dust on the
electric box that supposedly nobody touches.

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:48.170
It wasn't possessed or anything,
but someone had actually turned it off.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:53.660
And that's the person who I
suspected to be the ghost you see.

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:00.380
Last night, I'm sure Kimio...

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:05.920
No way...

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:11.940
Ugh! Looks like I have no choice.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.010
I'm desperate, I'll do anything at this point!

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:22.920
Ghost Buster!!!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:34.800
Wait,

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:35.890
you're not getting away!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.280
Run Watanuki!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.610
Don't ask, just go!

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.450
And that's how you were able to get away.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:48.490
Even though they accused him of being the peeper.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:49.730
Right?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.170
You almost hit it spot on.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.460
Wow, it's as if you saw the whole thing.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.030
Tell me, Watanuki-San.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.520
Why were you pretending to be a ghost?

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.570
At first it was an accident...

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:09.500
I picked up a towel and opened
it in front of the window,

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.470
and one of the girls saw it
and thought it was a ghost.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.980
From there, people started gaining
interest in the ghost stories.

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:20.150
I was getting happy that
people were listening to me.

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:22.970
But... that's not all...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.360
It felt so good for me to believe
I was becoming the ghost...

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.260
It made me more excited than anything.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.820
Something extraordinary every day, huh?

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:40.770
But it's like I thought...
It's no good if it's not the real thing.

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:45.050
But in the end, I couldn't
make Nozomi-Chan excited.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.810
Looks like you didn't have any
bad intentions after all, huh?

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:51.420
It was just a prank.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.970
And the culprit was me, the peeping tom.

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.840
If that's what everyone thinks, isn't that fine?

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:58.340
Suga-kun.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:02.070
It'd be better if you
quit the swimming club.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.380
Don't worry about me for a while, you two.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:08.160
Girls that were rejected
can be scary, I hear.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:13.670
Nozomi-Chan, I'm going to go
tell the girls the truth...

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:17.670
Girls should not get involved with boy stuff.

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:36.200
I thought I told you not
to talk to me for a while.

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:39.000
Even though I know the truth?

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:42.490
If you say something now,
nobody will believe you.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.400
I'll just wait until this passes over.

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:49.340
Thinking about it...
people are treating me like a pervert now.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.350
Which means your blackmail is useless against me.

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.360
Kimio-kun...

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.360
Our little game is over too.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.660
Finally, the yukata-date I've been waiting for.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.660
I'm so glad to be alive.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.520
It must be a miracle for
Komine-San to have come too.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.650
Oh, I invited her... since
she helped out last time.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:21.260
Komine-san's fine but... who would've thought
that Suga-kun was actually the culprit.

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:25.300
I know right?
Nobody would've thought it was Suga.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:27.080
U-um...

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.130
Nice!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.770
Amazing, as expected from a genius.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.330
I know right...

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:42.080
You know? Those ghost stories at the
pool have been around for a long time.

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:47.100
But you know Mirei, there are always
stories that are real and made up.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.170
B-but this one is real!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.720
We get it, we get it, you can tell us next time.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.430
It's real you know...

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:58.820
after investigating, there's some sort of spirit

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:01.420
that's angry at the poll. I'm not mistaken.

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:07.750
Do you guys really want to prove
that the ghost you saw was Suga-kun?

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:13.980
Hey... isn't it kind of bad
to be trespassing here.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.980
Even if you say that now...

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.410
By the way Mirei, where's Komine-San?

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.710
She said her stomach was
hurting so she went home.

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.650
Why? She's the one that said we should come here!

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:25.250
Yes, that's why...

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:27.250
...maybe it's the...

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:28.610
...ghost's curse!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:35.910
Damn Komine, why did you call
me out to this scary place?!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.540
I don't even have any blackmail against me now...

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.700
What are you saying?!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.500
Komine...

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.640
Aren't you frustrated, Kimio-kun?

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:47.490
The way the swimming club's treating you
after helping to investigate the ghost?

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.130
How you're now a pervert to them?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.920
It's a little too late to say that...

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.100
Well I'm frustrated!

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.310
I'm pissed, I couldn't protect you.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.810
They're talking about something that's not real.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:00.390
It frustrates me how they can
believe anything unreal so easily.

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.090
Oi...

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.770
It frustrates me that they don't know
about the same Kimio-kun that I know.

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.420
Even though I was with you.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:15.600
What're you say...
You're not wearing a bra?!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:16.870
Duh, it's a kimono.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.340
Watanuki and the other should be here soon.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:22.340
Help out too, Kimio-kun.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.970
What do I...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.850
Hey, I can't see anything!

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.250
That's good for now.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:29.810
What the heck are you doing?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.370
Ultimate plan: Make the ghost become real.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:42.340
I guess.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:47.810
Hey Mirei, let's stop.

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:52.180
Yeah, the ghost was just Suga.
So nothing's gonna come out.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:56.210
We could've at least brought a flashlight.

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:59.500
We can see our club room from here.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:04.620
L-looks like nothing's there.

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:08.600
I-I agree, there's no such thing as
ghosts or apparitions in this world.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.240
Looks like it was a success eh, Kimio-kun.

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:29.520
Yeah.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:40.630
If you keep staring at me like that,
I'll get embarrassed too.

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:42.660
Ah, sorry!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.230
Nozomi-Chan!

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:48.180
That was awesome! You looked like a real ghost!

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:50.890
Of course, I was going all out.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.320
Oh, you were here Suga-kun?

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:58.220
I Was! I was in charge of the lighting effects!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.920
Alrighty...

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:09.440
I don't know if you're there or not but,
either way let's pray to the ghost of the pool.

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:36.070
Job well done.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.600
Sorry, Suga-kun.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.820
There really was an apparition at our pool.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.280
It was really freaking scary!

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:54.930
I heard from Mirei that...

00:19:55.090 --> 00:20:00.120
You were there that day because
you were keeping watch for us.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:04.860
I knew from the start that
Suga-kun wasn't a peeping tom.

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:05.930
Me too!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.210
Same!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.980
Good thing you weren't scared, eh? Kimio-kun.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.930
When you lit me with the flashlight,
everyone got scared.

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.680
How would I get scared if I'm expecting it?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.570
Besides, I'm not really a scaredy-cat.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:30.540
Is that any way to talk for someone who
was afraid of a dark place and ghosts?

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.930
I can't hide anything from you...

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.470
Impossible.

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:41.420
Why would I got scared...

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:44.480
...from someone who was always by my side?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.660
Then, the game goes on!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.670
Guess it can't be helped.

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:31.570
Hey, Kimio-kun.

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:33.850
What's your favorite part about May?

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:34.810
Red and white manjuu.

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:37.170
How about your favorite thing with "no"?

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:38.300
Fermented nori.

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:41.970
If the first word is "Ko" and the 4th word is "no"...

00:22:41.970 --> 00:22:43.970
What's your favorite thing?

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:45.970
Cola Lid (old bean shaped bottles).

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:49.210
Ahh! Kimio-kun, you jerk!

00:22:49.210 --> 00:22:50.200
Hey, Komine!

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:52.200
Komine!!!

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.060
Next time: Nozo x Kimi Ep. 3

00:22:55.320 --> 00:22:56.210
"Our heartbeat"

00:22:57.210 --> 00:22:59.100
Not like I really like those lids...
